### US-010: VNC viewer for quick UI verification
Status: in_progress
Depends on: US-002, US-006

Description:
As a user, I want a VNC viewer optimized for short verification tasks.

Acceptance Criteria:
- [ ] Implement trackpad mode for pointer control and gestures
- [ ] Provide zoom bar with center-on-pointer behavior
- [ ] Example: open VNC from timeline event and exit with swipe down
- [ ] Negative case: VNC stream failure shows a clear recovery action


